# Footer Conventions

When creating a footer component or footer section, always include:

- **Copyright** with the current year (use `new Date().getFullYear()` for dynamic year)
- **All rights reserved**

Example:
```tsx
<p className="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
  &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} {siteName}. All rights reserved.
</p>
```
